{"id":"635303","name":"巧克力蜜豆包","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/635303/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"100g"},{"name":"小麦胚芽","amount":"30g"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"巧克力酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜜豆","amount":"200g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉、小麦胚芽、牛奶混合揉成面团。","img":"images/635303/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"表面刷玉米油盖盖子送冰箱静置8小时。","img":"images/635303/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"取出来加酵母。","img":"images/635303/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/635303/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"擀成薄片卷成长条。","img":"images/635303/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分等份。","img":"images/635303/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蜜豆加巧克力酱拌匀。","img":"images/635303/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀皮加蜜豆馅。","img":"images/635303/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包成包子。","img":"images/635303/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包子倒扣整理装入蒸锅。发酵30分钟。","img":"images/635303/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烤面包剩下的蛋黄液刷在表面。也可以省略此步骤。中火起锅，开锅后十分钟到15分钟即可。具体根据面胚大小来定。关火焖两分钟。","img":"images/635303/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"好啦！","img":"images/635303/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/635303/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"一起吃蜜豆包吧！","img":"images/635303/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}